              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami Ahasuwerusi ategeka ko mu bwami bwose no mu mazinga ya kure batanga ikori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ibikorwa vyiwe vyose vy’inkomezi n’ububasha bwiwe, hamwe n’inkuru yuzuye ivuga ivy’ubukuru bwa Moridekayi ubwo yahawe n’umwami, mbega ntivyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyagenda biraba c’abami b’Abamedi n’Abaperesi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moridekayi Umuyuda yari uwa kabiri inyuma y’umwami Ahasuwerusi, akomeye mu Bayuda bose, kandi yari afise icubahiro muri benewabo b’Abayuda, kuko yakora arondera ineza y’ubwoko bwabo kandi akavugira Abayuda ngo babe mu mahoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
